    "corrections": [
      "abstention is a complete-layer-group outcome; any non-UNKNOWN layer makes group abstention false",
      "per-layer non-abstention and hallucination are recomputed from generated/re-decoded outputs, not host flags",
      "generation requests, prefill forwards, decode forwards, generated tokens, layer readout streams and processed positions are separate counters",
